                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Planet of the Eyes is a linear platformer with basic gameplay and common level design features. There seems to be a story, told by the tapes collected on the way, but it's your typical \"mysterious story that remains mysterious to hide that it has nothing to tell\" story. Planet of the Eyes can certainly be a nice game for a young audience or casual gamers, but otherwise it does not have much to offer.",
